cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "PathVariance"
abstract: >-
  A command line tool that measures whether an AI agent solves the same task
  the same way twice, by canonicalising repeated runs into path signatures and
  reporting the path distribution, Shannon entropy, and first divergence index.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "the PathVariance authors"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-02"
license: MIT
